        "ggDzcbrjNHJ_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:#636363;font-size:16px;\">It was a great experience. The cut felt smooth and gentle, with no discomfort at all. I really like the result and am very happy with the look.</span></p>",
        "ggIowbepHDb_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:#575757;font-size:18px;\"><sup>It is my first time trying GLYDE, and I am impressed by how fast and beginner-friendly it was. The whole process felt easy and enjoyable. GLYDE truly feels like a game changer—I love it.</sup></span></p>",
        "ggOOyqGzI-9_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:#636363;font-size:18px;\"><sup>I tried GLYDE’s smart hair clipper. It delivered a modern, tech-driven solution that really stood out. An impressive product.</sup></span></p>",
